config BR2_PACKAGE_PTPING
	bool "ptping"
	help
	  Measure one-way latency across a network with PTP Sync
	  messages as probes, timestamped in hardware at both ends.
	  Probes can be sent within a window of a cyclic schedule, or
	  tagged by where in the cycle they left, to check an IEEE
	  802.1Qbv gate control list from a neighboring station.

	  https://github.com/wkz/ptping
